<html xmlns='http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml'>
  <head>
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <meta name='x-apple-disable-message-reformatting' />
    <meta http-equiv='Content-Type' content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' />
    <meta name='color-scheme' content='light' />
    <meta name='supported-color-schemes' content='light' />
    <title>Welcome to DORY PH, INC. - Partner Onboarding</title>
    <style type='text/css' rel='stylesheet' media='all'>
      @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Nunito+Sans:400,600,700,800&display=swap');

      body {
        width: 100% !important;
        height: 100%;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: none;
        background-color: #f0faf3;
        color: #234232;
      }

      body,
      td,
      th {
        font-family: 'Nunito Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      }

      td {
        word-break: break-word;
      }

      .preheader {
        display: none !important;
        visibility: hidden;
        mso-hide: all;
        font-size: 1px;
        line-height: 1px;
        max-height: 0;
        max-width: 0;
        opacity: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .email-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f0faf3;
      }
      .email-content {
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .email-masthead {
        padding: 28px 0 18px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .email-masthead_name {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        color: #22a85a;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .email-body_inner {
        width: 570px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 14px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(31, 138, 76, 0.12);
      }

      .email-hero {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22a85a 0%, #15833f 100%);
        padding: 34px 45px;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .email-hero .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        padding: 5px 12px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: #eafff1;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      }
      .email-hero h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 23px;
        font-weight: 800;
      }
      .email-hero p {
        margin: 8px 0 0;
        color: #d8f5e3;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .content-cell {
        padding: 32px 45px 40px;
      }
      .content-cell p {
        color: #3c5a48;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.65;
        margin: 0 0 18px;
      }
      .content-cell a {
        color: #1f8a4c;
        word-break: break-all;
      }
      .content-cell h2 {
        margin: 28px 0 6px;
        color: #1f8a4c;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .credentials {
        background-color: #f4fbf6;
        border: 1px solid #d7eede;
        border-left: 4px solid #22a85a;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 20px 22px;
        margin: 0 0 26px;
      }
      .credentials .cred-label {
        color: #1f8a4c;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.6px;
        margin: 0 0 4px;
      }
      .credentials .cred-value {
        color: #234232;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        font-family:
          'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', Menlo, monospace;
      }
      .credentials .cred-desc {
        color: #3c5a48;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.55;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .step {
        background-color: #f4fbf6;
        border: 1px solid #d7eede;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 16px 20px 2px;
        margin: 0 0 14px;
      }
      .step .step-title {
        color: #1f8a4c;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin: 0 0 8px;
      }
      .step p {
        font-size: 14px;
        margin: 0 0 12px;
      }
      .step ul {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        padding-left: 20px;
        color: #3c5a48;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .cta-wrap {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 0 8px;
      }
      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 13px 30px;
        background-color: #22a85a;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      .email-footer {
        width: 570px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .email-footer p {
        color: #8fb6a0;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        padding: 22px 0;
        margin: 0;
      }

      @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .email-body_inner,
        .email-footer {
          width: 100% !important;
        }
        .email-hero,
        .content-cell {
          padding-left: 24px !important;
          padding-right: 24px !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <span class='preheader'>Welcome to DORY PH, INC. — your partner account is
      ready. Follow the onboarding steps below.</span>
    <table
      class='email-wrapper'
      width='100%'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      role='presentation'
    >
      <tr>
        <td align='center'>
          <table
            class='email-content'
            width='100%'
            cellpadding='0'
            cellspacing='0'
            role='presentation'
          >
            <tr>
              <td class='email-masthead'>
                <a
                  href='https://platform.dorydelivery.com'
                  class='email-masthead_name'
                  style='color: #22a85a; text-decoration: none;'
                >DORY DELIVERY</a>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td width='570' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0'>
                <table
                  class='email-body_inner'
                  align='center'
                  width='570'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  role='presentation'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td class='email-hero'>
                      <span class='badge'>Partner Onboarding</span>
                      <h1>Welcome to DORY PH, INC.!</h1>
                      <p>Your partner account has been successfully created.
                        We are excited to have you join our growing network of
                        partners.</p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>

                  <tr>
                    <td class='content-cell'>
                      <p>Dear {{fullName}},</p>

                      <p>Welcome to DORY PH, INC. We are pleased to inform you
                        that your partner account has been successfully
                        created.</p>

                      <h2 style='margin-top: 8px;'>Account Access Details</h2>
                      <div class='credentials'>
                        <p class='cred-label'>Username</p>
                        <p class='cred-value'>{{username}}</p>
                        <p class='cred-label'>Password</p>
                        <p class='cred-desc'>Please use the password you set
                          during registration. We can't show your password for
                          security reasons.</p>
                      </div>

                      <div class='cta-wrap'>
                        <a
                          href='{{loginUrl}}'
                          class='button'
                          target='_blank'
                        >Log in to Dory Partner Account</a>
                      </div>

                      <p style='margin-top: 18px;'>For account concerns,
                        technical issues, or other partner-related inquiries,
                        please raise your concern through our official DORY PH
                        Facebook Page:
                        <a
                          href='https://www.facebook.com/dorydelivery.main'
                          target='_blank'
                        >https://www.facebook.com/dorydelivery.main</a></p>

                      <h2>Onboarding Process</h2>
                      <p>To ensure a smooth and successful onboarding, please
                        complete the following steps in the order listed below.</p>

                      <div class='step'>
                        <p class='step-title'>Step 1: Review, Sign, and Submit
                          the Contract</p>
                        <p>Please review the contract thoroughly before
                          signing. The Dory Partners Contract is attached to
                          this email as a PDF.</p>
                        <p>Contract:
                          <a
                            href='https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oPvSRpGnWYcJvdTx-3BNadb17v63Wgxy/view?usp=drivesdk'
                            target='_blank'
                          >View the contract</a><br />
                          Sample Contract (Reference):
                          <a
                            href='https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HpjRbuUczde_I7kGwA0YXJw4LLWC8-7u/view?usp=drivesdk'
                            target='_blank'
                          >View the sample contract</a></p>
                        <p><strong>Instructions:</strong></p>
                        <ul>
                          <li>Print three (3) copies of the Dory Delivery
                            Contract.</li>
                          <li>Refer to the Sample Contract as your guide when
                            completing the documents.</li>
                          <li>Sign all required pages.</li>
                          <li>Send the signed contracts via courier within
                            fourteen (14) days to the following address:<br
                            /><strong>DORY PH, INC.</strong><br />0906-195-4380<br
                            />Castelo Commercial Building, 2nd Floor<br
                            />Purok 1, Brgy. Sotero Nuesa<br />Roxas, Isabela
                            3320</li>
                        </ul>
                      </div>

                      <div class='step'>
                        <p class='step-title'>Step 2: Watch the Onboarding
                          Video</p>
                        <p>This video provides an overview of DORY PH, our
                          services, and your responsibilities as a partner.<br
                          /><a
                            href='https://drive.google.com/open?id=17v6u2OCfsEzqSbFqbkydrFsOQfMGfGiI&amp;usp=drive_copy'
                            target='_blank'
                          >Watch the onboarding video</a></p>
                      </div>

                      <div class='step'>
                        <p class='step-title'>Step 3: Complete the DORY IMC
                          Checklist</p>
                        <p>Please complete the checklist to ensure that all
                          onboarding requirements have been fulfilled.<br
                          /><a
                            href='https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1QHZgGe6dA5Lmal_8BsdGXGwdBmDEcvk5/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=103746329316027714756&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true'
                            target='_blank'
                          >Open the DORY IMC Checklist</a></p>
                      </div>

                      <div class='step'>
                        <p class='step-title'>Step 4: Follow the Official DORY
                          Facebook Page</p>
                        <p>Please follow our official Facebook Page to stay
                          updated with important announcements, company
                          updates, and other relevant information. For partner
                          concerns and inquiries, please send your message
                          through this page.<br /><a
                            href='https://www.facebook.com/dorydelivery.main'
                            target='_blank'
                          >Official DORY PH Facebook Page</a></p>
                      </div>

                      <div class='step'>
                        <p class='step-title'>Step 5: Join the Official DORY
                          Facebook Group</p>
                        <p>Stay connected with fellow partners and receive
                          important announcements, updates, and community
                          information.<br /><a
                            href='https://www.facebook.com/share/g/1DmCqktDTP/'
                            target='_blank'
                          >Join the Official DORY Facebook Group</a></p>
                      </div>

                      <div class='step'>
                        <p class='step-title'>Step 6: Watch the System Training
                          Video</p>
                        <p>Learn how to navigate and maximize the features of
                          the Dory Partner System.<br /><a
                            href='https://drive.google.com/file/d/1i_-jXDnsnGBQqh8YKOp9OOIzrDt0zmFg/view?usp=drive_link'
                            target='_blank'
                          >Watch the system training video</a></p>
                      </div>

                      <div class='step'>
                        <p class='step-title'>Step 7: Read the Partner
                          Operations Manual</p>
                        <p>Please read the manual carefully, as it contains
                          important operational policies, procedures, and best
                          practices that will guide your day-to-day operations.<br
                          /><a
                            href='https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bmGROh4b2Bss69nkkqzD-IA9UH0GHjnY/view?usp=drive_link'
                            target='_blank'
                          >Read the Partner Operations Manual</a></p>
                      </div>

                      <p style='margin-top: 22px;'>If you have any questions or
                        need assistance during the onboarding process, please
                        raise your concern through our official DORY PH
                        Facebook Page so that our team can properly assist you.</p>

                      <p>Once again, welcome to DORY PH, INC. We look forward
                        to building a successful and lasting partnership with
                        you.</p>

                      <p style='margin-top: 26px;'>Kind regards,<br /><strong
                          style='color: #1f8a4c;'
                        >Dory Admin</strong><br />DORY PH, INC.</p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td>
                <table
                  class='email-footer'
                  align='center'
                  width='570'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  role='presentation'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td align='center'>
                      <p>
                        &copy;
                        {{year}}
                        DORY PH, INC. All rights reserved.<br />
                        This email was sent because you registered as a Dory
                        partner.
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
